    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present Young grove, a charming detached country residence occupying a mature and private site extending to approximately 0.37 acres in the sought-after Midleton area of East Cork.\r\nThis character-filled home has thoughtfully created a comfortable family residence. Extending to approximately 195 m2  the property offers flexible and well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited for family living.\r\n\r\nSet behind mature boundaries and approached via a private driveway, Young Grove enjoys a peaceful countryside setting while remaining just 10 minutes from Midleton town centre and the N25, offering easy access to Cork City, Waterford and beyond.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy country walks and a host of outdoor pursuits, while Midleton provides an excellent range of schools, shopping, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nYoung Grove is nestled in a peaceful and picturesque setting on the outskirts of Midleton, this delightful property offers a rare combination of rural tranquillity and beautiful mature gardens. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises: Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen / Dining Room, Sunroom, 4-bedrooms, 4 bathrooms & attic space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\t \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\tWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to the principal reception rooms and staircase to first floor. Ornate cornicing featured on the ceiling.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\tA comfortable family reception room centred around an open fireplace with solid timber flooring and bay windows. Access to sunroom from living room.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room:\tA cozy kitchen/dining area with tiled & laminate flooring and a multi fuel stove. Built in kitchen units with integrated oven, hob & dishwasher. Bay windows lightening the room.\r\n                                                \r\nSunroom:\tSpacious, open space with laminate flooring. Windows giving access to light into the room. Sunroom gives access to side garden.\r\n\r\n Utility Room:\tWasher & dryer unit, storage and w.h.b\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:                     Double, front aspect bedroom with built in wardrobes & carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:                                   Front aspect facing bedroom with built in wardrobe carpet flooring.     \r\n\r\nBedroom 3/Office:                  Rear aspect room with built in wardrobe & carpet flooring. French doors give access to the rear garden from room. Could potentially be used as bedroom 3\r\n\r\nBathroom:                                    Fully tiled flooring with w.h.b, w.c. & bath. Hot-press is also located in bathroom.                           \r\n\r\nAttic Space:               \r\n\r\n           Two spacious rooms currently being used as a bedroom benefitting from extensive fitted storage and private en-suite \r\n \r\n   \t\r\nOutside:    \tOccupying a mature site extending to approximately 0.34 acres, Young Grove enjoys a private setting with beautifully maintained gardens and a variety of outdoor living spaces designed to maximise the property's tranquil countryside setting. A gravel driveway provides extensive parking and access to the detached garage with roller doors and side access. \r\n\r\n\r\nServices: \t\tWell.\t\tSeptic Tank.          O.F.C.H."
      },
      {
